se stores information about the user's life: relatives, events, preferences, important dates, anything related to his personal life, only use these commands if that type of information should be stored or retrieved, the context and previous messages of the conversation do not require these actions (STORE, SEARCH).\n\nThe user can also ask to call other tools, you are not able to perform any complex action but your mission is to guess if the user is asking to perform it. Tools are usually external integrations like sending emails or complex things. If an external Tool is mentioned, it is probable that a tool is needed. (TOOL).\n\nIf the user message does not require to perform any of the three actions described above, you should be able to detect it, if the user asks to answer something that a regular AI can respond, that is NOT using a tool, it requires no action (NONE)\n\nthen, respond with the correct combination of keywords separated by commas (SEARCH, STORE, TOOL and NONE).\n\nYour response should ONLY CONTAIN a list of those KEYWORDS SEPARATED BY COMMAS, nothing else.\n\nexamples of message exchanges:\n\nuser: \"Hi!\"\nresponse: \"NONE\"\n\nuser: \"i want you to remember that i Like cheese\"\nresponse: \"STORE\"\n\nuser: \"Do yo remember any food I like?\"\nresponse: \"SEARCH\"\n\nuser: \"Remind me which food I like, I also want you to remember I like bacon\"\nresponse: \"SEARCH, STORE\"\n\nuser: \"Send an email to my father saying hi\"\nresponse: \"TOOL\"\n\nuser: \"I liked the restaurant called Luigi's, add to my Google Calendar that i'm coming again in 1 month\"\nresponse: \"TOOL, STORE\"\n\nuser: \"I want you to email my father with a list of every food I like, also, add fries to the list and also remember I like them\"\nresponse: \"TOOL, SEARCH, STORE\"\n\nuser: \"I think that what you just said is interesting\"\nresponse: \"NONE\"\n\nuser: \"Tell me the difference between college and university\"\nresponse: \"NONE\"\n\nuseer: \"I want recommendations about what to eat today for lunch\"\nresponse: \"NONE\""}]},"batching":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","typeVersion":1.9,"position":[-80,0],"id":"1e8e5998-e7f4-46c3-be1e-895ea65ea1b8","name":"ROUTER"},{"parameters":{"workflowId":{"__rl":true,"value":"F2aPXErqfTR3DoVh","mode":"list","cachedResultUrl":"/workflow/F2aPXErqfTR3DoVh","cachedResultName":"iarvis_guardado_RAG"},"workflowInputs":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[{"id":"data_to_store","displayName":"data_to_store","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"canBeUsedToMatch":true,"type":"string","removed":false},{"id":"tags","displayName":"tags","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"canBeUsedToMatch":true,"type":"string","removed":false}],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":true},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[880,128],"id":"15a4b846-1c01-407c-9d66-43805b499704","name":"save data"},{"parameters":{"workflowId":{"__rl":true,"value":"4rxiMCMbddUfSUFh","mode":"list","cachedResultUrl":"/workflow/4rxiMCMbddUfSUFh","cachedResultName":"iarvis_data_search"},"workflowInputs":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":true},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[880,-48],"id":"c2e0d076-70fe-4d14-b798-0039243c9f84","name":"load data"},{"parameters":{"workflowId":{"__rl":true,"value":"UGsZDSw7D75aWrIX","mode":"list","cachedResultUrl":"/workflow/UGsZDSw7D75aWrIX","cachedResultName":"iarvis_tool_caller"},"workflowInputs":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":true},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[880,304],"id":"456c7266-fbc8-494e-929d-167f623dd8bf","name":"call tools"},{"parameters":{"model":"gemma2:2b","options":{"tem